{
  "description": "Request and response examples for every /api/v1/blueprints route (issue #759, Layouts slice E of #424). <tmp> is the test's own directory, <proj> under it a registered project, <tmp>/app a git repository on master; <blueprint_uuid_N>, <layout_uuid_N>, <session_id> and <timestamp> stand for generated values. Regenerated and checked by tests/test_blueprints_contract_fixture.py. Model: docs/blueprints.md.",
